title: Arlo
---
Something stirs within as Lyre opens her third eye.
First, nothing.
Then, vision returns.
ARLO: There is a visitor!
Lyre: Heed my words, strange ro-
ARLO: Be welcomed! Be welcomed!
ARLO: Will the visitor aid? 
ARLO: Will the visitor aid ARLO in returning to the surface?
Lyre: No! I’m here to tell you that you need to leave! At once!
ARLO: Affirmative! Will the visitor aid ARLO to leave the premise of this cave?
Lyre: Not the cave! You need to leave this planet! 
ARLO: The visitor knows the way?
Lyre: Yes! I mean- no! You need to get off the planet!
ARLO: ARLO is to return to the surface. The visitor will help.
Lyre: ...
Lyre: I will help you out of the cave.
Lyre: As long as you and your robotic friends leave this planet after.
ARLO: Gratitude! ARLO is to share with the visitor its code. Please, stand by.
Lyre: I’m not consenting to you putting code in my head!
ARLO: It is done!

Lyre: ARLO, do you see anything that could help me open the gate your friends built?
ARLO: ARLO will look.
===
